    <briefdescription>
<para>Splits a document into overlapping text chunks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Performance targets (1 MB / ~250 k-token document, Intel Core i7):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Fixed strategy: &lt; 5 ms</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sliding strategy: &lt; 5 ms</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sentence strategy: &lt; 20 ms (sentence detection adds minor overhead) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
